WEBVTT

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.340
My soul, Red Dragon Archfiend...

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.390
What's wrong, Bommer?

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.060
You're sweating.  Are you okay?

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.820
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:51.810
I'm sorry that I woke you up.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.830
Go back to sleep.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.460
Good night.

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:01.860
That was Jack Atlas.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.810
Why did he appear in my dream?

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.980
That dragon was Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.050
Jack's own monster attacked him.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:31.970
To Yusei Fudo

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:55.060
I never thought that I would see 
these horrible drawings again.

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.360
Yeah.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.240
Riding Duels.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:10.450
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:17.260
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:38.500
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:48.610
Soar in the infinite skies  BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.850
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:02:55.220 --> 00:03:00.830
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:06.600
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:12.200
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:18.580
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:24.380
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:30.690
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:37.000
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:06.660
To the Ancient Land of Nazca

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.660
Three Days Ago

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:18.790
Since the WRGP preliminaries are suspended, 
wonderful times are starting again.

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:24.980
He's lovely when he's driving, but watching 
Jack gracefully drink his coffee is the best!

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:28.010
Umm, can you take my order?

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.480
Refill!

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:30.700
Okay!

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:32.450
Hey, wait!

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:42.180
Jack Atlas, taste my power!

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.200
Iliaster's three emperors!

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:54.940
Iliaster?

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.510
Team 5D's...

00:04:57.510 --> 00:05:02.650
If you want to battle us, 
you must win the WRGP!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:06.430
All the answers are at the WRGP!

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.230
Can I beat them in my current state?

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.160
Accel Synchro!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.560
If I also don't find a new way to fight...

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.870
I won't be able to defeat them.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:26.040
But my fighting technique is 
to use power to apply pressure.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.290
It's the only way.

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:29.780
Thanks for waiting.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.720
Unyielding power...

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:35.980
What are you doing?

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.350
What are you doing here?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.710
Look at this!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.190
12 cups of Blue-Eyes Mountain for 36,000 yen?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.320
You're starting to waste money again!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.660
WRGP isn't over yet!

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.230
What are you talking about?

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:55.170
I was drinking coffee so that I would be 
inspired to come up with new strategies!

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:56.670
I'm including this in the expenses!

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.400
I won't allow that!

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.240
What?

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.100
What?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:05.080
I received a message that might 
lead to your new fighting method.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.040
What?

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:15.050
I'm surprised Crow approved 
the travel expenses.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:19.360
It took a lot of work to convince him, but 
he finally approved the travel expenses.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.090
But I don't know about your coffee budget.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:26.880
Anyway, I'm surprised Bommer is here.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:30.810
A message from a dream is stupid.  However...

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.570
This is what Bommer's e-mail said:

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:41.290
If Jack Atlas doesn't find a new way to 
battle, he'll perish due to his own power.

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:45.250
It's like a cliché from 
a fake fortuneteller.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:51.990
But he's right.  I've been thinking 
of a new way to battle for days.

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:53.740
And I reached a conclusion.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.390
You'll battle by using 
power to apply pressure?

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.200
Yeah, that's the only way.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:05.310
But Jack, I think you're unsure whether 
that's really the best way to battle.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:06.680
That why you're here.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.080
Bommer!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:33.600
Yusei.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.420
Thanks for coming.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.460
Jack, long time no see.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:44.550
I came because of your practical joke.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:47.830
What's this temple?

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:53.250
I built it to appease the Earthbound 
Immortals that have returned to this land as geoglyphs.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.780
Appease the Earthbound Immortals...

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.960
They're my siblings Max and Annie.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:07.610
You've reunited with your 
family, Bommer.  That's great!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.170
Hooray!  It's the King!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.800
I'm not the King!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.610
I'm sorry.

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:20.710
When the Earthbound Immortals 
took their souls,

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.240
they don't remember 
anything during that time.

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:26.730
That's why they still think 
that Jack Atlas is the King.

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:29.450
Actually, Max-

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:30.400
Be quiet, Bommer!

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.920
Your brother is correct!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:36.390
There's only one King!  Jack Atlas!

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.330
Having a family is great.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:46.350
After the battle, when I reunited 
with my siblings in my hometown,

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.810
I finally was happy again.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:53.850
The three of us left on a journey 
to search for a new goal.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:09:01.770
But before long, I realized that I 
wasn't traveling to find a new goal.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.360
I was traveling in order 
to escape from my crimes.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:11.720
Bommer, you're wrong.  You 
don't need to feel guilty.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.730
But I couldn't forgive myself.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:17.630
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:21.920
One choice is to forget about 
my mistakes and move on.

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:25.420
But I made a different choice.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.950
I decided to move on while 
holding on to my mistakes.

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.960
Hold on to your mistakes?

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:34.130
That's right.  Instead of running 
away, I would face my mistakes.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:40.150
That led me and my siblings to this land.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:46.210
After the battle between the Signers and Dark 
Signers, the Earthbound Immortals were sealed away.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:51.350
But there's no guarantee that a different evil 
won't try to use the Earthbound Immortals again.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.070
This land seals away various spirits.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:10:01.880
We built a temple to appease the Earthbound 
Immortals and the other spirits.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.960
We decided to stay here as their guardians.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.350
But recently…

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:16.530
Livestock have died for unknown 
reasons in various villages.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:22.110
People say it's because of the Crimson Devil.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:26.620
Crimson Devil?

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:35.220
A few spirits must have 
escaped from the earth.

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:39.510
Something is trying to 
resurrect from this land.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:46.730
Is this related to Iliaster's 
exploits at Neo Domino City?

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:51.680
Are the evil god and Earthbound 
Immortals going to resurrect?

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:53.210
I don't know.

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:59.010
But it may be impossible to seal everything.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:04.130
That's when I dreamed about you, Jack.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.150
This isn't coincidence.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:12.610
I was able to sense it because the 
evil god overtook my soul in the past.

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.350
The dream was a premonition.

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:20.790
According to the dream, you're going 
to perish due to your own power, Jack.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:25.080
If you keep relying on power and 
don't change your ways in battle...

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:28.040
...you'll eventually fail.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:32.000
This dream could be a revelation 
to stop that from happening.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.980
It's telling you to find a battle 
technique that's the opposite of power.

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:40.180
I also thought about this a lot!

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:45.280
But my only battle strategy is to 
keep applying pressure with power!

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:48.780
Then show me that power!

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:52.660
Convince me that Jack Atlas is power!

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:55.790
In a Riding Duel.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.690
Do I have a way other than power?

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:21.920
What is it?

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.320
Well...

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.350
If you have something to say, 
then hurry up and say it.

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:26.710
Well then…

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:34.110
Jack, I want you to look at 
my deck.  I want your advice.

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:35.610
Show me.

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:41.760
It's a power deck.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.440
I adore the King.

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:47.850
That's why I copied your deck, Jack.

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:51.130
But I can't win like you.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.490
This is fine.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.470
Really?

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.390
Walk the path that you believe in.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:04.030
Your deck will respond to you eventually.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:06.450
The path that I believe in is the King!

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.800
To me, you're like Quetzalcoatl.

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:15.540
Quetzalcoatl?

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.810
He's a god that we worship here.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:23.560
There's also an engraving of our 
guardian Quetzalcoatl in this temple.

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.750
When I look at this, it 
always reminds me of Jack.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.720
He's strong and cool.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:32.460
And that he will guide us.

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:34.870
Quetzalcoatl…

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:05.180
This is a killer whale geoglyph.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.530
Here, brother.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.830
Thank you.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.490
I did as you asked.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:14.230
Thanks for your help, Yusei.

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:15.630
It's fine, but…

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:18.040
Why do you want a geoglyph?

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.600
It's a substitute for a duel lane.  Since 
it's bright, it'll be easier to see.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:23.070
Still…

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.840
I'm ready, Jack.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.080
Me too!

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:31.120
We can start anytime you want, Bommer.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:31.790
No.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:40.320
Jack, Max will be your opponent.

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:41.300
What?

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:42.560
Bommer!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.260
What's the meaning of this?

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:46.700
A child shouldn't battle Jack.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.210
Are you making fun of me?

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.030
Of course not.

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:55.010
He's the perfect opponent to 
bring out all your powers.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.740
But I just looked at Max's deck.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.490
I'll do it!

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:02.710
Nothing will make me happier 
than dueling the King!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.680
Well said, Max.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.140
Max…

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:12.400
Bommer, what are you thinking?

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:21.110
Why do I have to participate in this farce?

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:27.000
Jack, show the land your power!

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.460
Max…

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.580
Jack…  Bommer…

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.870
Set Speed World 2!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:37.960
Duel Mode on.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:39.920
Riding Duel!

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:41.810
Acceleration!

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:49.650
I'll let you have the corner!

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:53.860
Go, Max!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:55.570
My turn!

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:58.550
I summon Freedom Bird in defense position.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.910
I don't remember that 
monster in Max's deck...

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.790
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:11.940
My turn!

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:16.490
When monsters are only 
on the opponent's field,

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.690
I can Special Summon Vice 
Dragon from my hand.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:24.660
When Vice Dragon is Special Summoned due to this 
effect, its attack and defense points are halved!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:28.370
When you summon or Special Summon 
a monster on to your field...

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.370
...Freedom Bird's effect 
lets me Special Summon

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.950
one Freedom Bird from my 
deck in defense position!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:40.540
I summon Dark Resonator!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.990
I Special Summon a third Freedom Bird!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:54.700
Level 3 Dark Resonator 
tunes Level 5 Vice Dragon!

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.230
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:00.330
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.400
Synchro Summon!

00:17:02.590 --> 00:17:05.700
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:12.310
Red Dragon Archfiend's effect burns 
all monsters in defense position.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.310
I'll show you the power 
that's known worldwide!

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:18.180
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks Freedom Bird!

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:22.190
Due to its effect, all monsters 
in defense position are destroyed!

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.060
Demon Meteor!

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:30.260
You're not quaking in fear.  
I admire your courage.

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:31.430
I end my turn!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.960
My turn!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:39.260
When monsters are only on the opponent's 
field, I can Special Summon Bewitching Butterfly.

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:46.550
It's strange.  That monster 
also wasn't in his deck.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.890
Bewitching Butterfly is destroyed when

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:53.890
there's a monster on your 
field with more attack points.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.330
Why did you choose to self-destruct?

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:04.650
I Special Summon a second Bewitching 
Butterfly and destroy it.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:07.130
What?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:09.880
And a third!

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:14.150
Then I summon Ancestor 
Bird in defense position!

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.820
When there are three monsters in my graveyard

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:25.080
with the same name, Ancestor 
Bird can't be destroyed.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.080
What?

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:29.050
Red Dragon Archfiend's 
power has been sealed away?

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:33.550
That's why he was sacrificing 
cards with the same name!

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:36.790
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.670
His deck is tailored to 
stop Jack's power deck.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:44.850
He's doing surprisingly well.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.640
His eyes…

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.340
There's something inside him 
that I didn't sense before.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:03.660
My turn!

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.420
I summon Lancer Archfiend!

00:19:11.730 --> 00:19:17.850
Max, Red Dragon Archfiend's red soul 
will burn up your shallow strategy!

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:21.670
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks Ancestor Bird!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.210
What?

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:25.780
Ancestor Bird can't be 
destroyed because there are

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:28.110
three cards with the same 
name in the graveyard!

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:30.380
Lancer Archfiend's effect activates!

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:34.210
When my monster attacks, 
it deals piercing damage!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:38.480
My crimson power destroys everything!

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:40.960
Absolute Powerforce!

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:44.420
You're determined to use power to win?

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:49.390
I flip over the two Smoke Mirror trap cards!

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:52.770
When there are three monsters in 
my graveyard with the same name...

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:55.810
...one of my monster's 
defense points increase

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:58.880
by one of your monster's attack 
points until the End Phase.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:04.120
Ancestor Bird gains Red Dragon Archfiend's 
power and now has 6000 defense points!

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:05.080
What?

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:17.930
This is…

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:27.350
It's the same as my dream!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.450
Crimson Devil…

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:37.880
Jack!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.740
He will perish due to his own power…

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:43.440
It's happening!

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:54.940
Jack!

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.640
Jack, are you okay?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:01.610
Don't touch me!

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:09.490
Jack...

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:16.340
That wasn't enough to take away my power!

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.660
Jack, I'm sorry.

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:24.470
I just wanted you to rethink the way 
you battle instead of relying on power.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.340
Jack…

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:29.800
I won't abandon power!

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:34.460
Jack...

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:55.190
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:55.660 --> 00:22:01.900
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:20.180
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.820
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:31.430
You do this over and over

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:37.170
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:42.570
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:50.080
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:55.820
Close to you  If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:56.220 --> 00:23:01.660
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:07.130
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:07.630 --> 00:23:15.240
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
